  "description": "An experimental research prototype exploring the synthesis of Brainfuck's minimalistic tape-based memory model with the functional, stack-oriented combinators of the Joy programming language. It aims to provide a formal substrate for investigating hybrid concatenative-esoteric execution models and their semantic properties within a low-level runtime context.",
